+# Password hashing
+
+No password hashing algorithm is currently recorded as a project decision. The only thing on record about it is a brief, unconfirmed remark from the project owner naming argon2id, made without any rationale, parameters or follow-up confirmation, so it is not treated as an adopted decision. Until a decision is explicitly made and recorded, this policy specifies no algorithm and no parameters.
